# S62-4: e1m1's start, the perspective span at id's 16 too. e1m1's start, a still camera,
# the status bar and the gun ("Every change has a name. Every name can be switched off").
# S62-0 is the slop preset; each next render switches one more option off (1 Hor+, 2 the
# scaled 2-D layer, 3 the status bar overlay, 4 the perspective span back to 16, 5 smooth
# monsters, 6 gliding lights, 7 the torch flicker); S62-8 is the Classic preset (960x600
# in its 4:3 box, id's 72 Hz ticks).
#
# Assembly (S62): S62-0 until file second 1.4; from then, every 0.4 s, a 0.2 s dissolve
# (smoothstep) to the next render, ending on S62-8 at 4.2. At the right, on a dark band, a
# column names the options in turn ("no 72 cap" last), each struck through in lava as its
# render takes over.

map e1m1

duration 6.8
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar fov_adapt 0
cvar wasm_scaled2d 0
cvar scr_sbaroverlay 0
cvar r_perspspan 16

camera fixed 480,-352,110 0,90

sound off
events on
